{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231980/extras/1e0b34d9fd96d3a683c32f3c6f103789.poster.avif?t=1768912612\" width=1170 height=515 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231980/extras/1e0b34d9fd96d3a683c32f3c6f103789.webm?t=1768912612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When the hordes of Hell grow stronger and the Eternal Balance is at risk, Heaven must strike back. As their last line of defense, they unleash the Hellreaper. By sacrificing one of the High Angels, they create a devastating, uncontrollable force that might restore order.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With the aid of a mysterious entity known as The Three Sisters, you will uncover the secrets of Hell\u2019s corruption - and more. There will also be cats. Probably\u2026 with cats, you can never be sure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231980/extras/71a580b3c9afd70660460e2d13a73c5c.poster.avif?t=1768912612\" width=1170 height=515 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231980/extras/71a580b3c9afd70660460e2d13a73c5c.webm?t=1768912612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HELLREAPER</strong>\u00a0is a tough but fair game with highly responsive controls. We at Awesome Games Studio are a small indie team, but also passionate players. In our previous titles, such as <strong>Fury Unleashed</strong> and <strong>Yet Another Zombie Survivors</strong>, we worked closely with our community to deliver the most enjoyable experiences possible. We strive to make our games as awesome as they can be.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2231980?t=1768912612","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2231980?t=1768912612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231980/fe11a41778572873de7cc8b6ef2b21713545f7b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768912612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231980/fe11a41778572873de7cc8b6ef2b21713545f7b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768912612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Frequently depicted violence against non-realistic creatures"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231980/extras/1e0b34d9fd96d3a683c32f3c6f103789.poster.avif?t=1768912612\" width=1170 height=515 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231980/extras/1e0b34d9fd96d3a683c32f3c6f103789.webm?t=1768912612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When the hordes of Hell grow stronger and the Eternal Balance is at risk, Heaven must strike back. As their last line of defense, they unleash the Hellreaper. By sacrificing one of the High Angels, they create a devastating, uncontrollable force that might restore order.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With the aid of a mysterious entity known as The Three Sisters, you will uncover the secrets of Hell\u2019s corruption - and more. There will also be cats. Probably\u2026 with cats, you can never be sure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231980/extras/71a580b3c9afd70660460e2d13a73c5c.poster.avif?t=1768912612\" width=1170 height=515 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231980/extras/71a580b3c9afd70660460e2d13a73c5c.webm?t=1768912612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HELLREAPER</strong>\u00a0is a tough but fair game with highly responsive controls. We at Awesome Games Studio are a small indie team, but also passionate players. In our previous titles, such as <strong>Fury Unleashed</strong> and <strong>Yet Another Zombie Survivors</strong>, we worked closely with our community to deliver the most enjoyable experiences possible. We strive to make our games as awesome as they can be.</p>","developers":["Awesome Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231980/8c9fb59100f6e316810a4c8d11c2c5a2a305704b/header.jpg?t=1768912612","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2231980/1349336006/f954511756b41b6083bbecdc5417d31846c4a606/1759160990/das